# scripts/ split rule (t_c954f119): production runtime tooling IS tracked
# (daemon, prune, restart, deploy/monitor/verify scripts); only one-off
# scratch is kept out of git here.
#
# Scratch conventions in this directory:
#   _*.py            — one-off probes / ad-hoc diagnostics (_probe_*, _verify_*, ...)
#   *.bak-*          — timestamped backup copies of scripts we superseded
#   <empty>          — zero-byte leftovers that were never filled in
_*.py
*.bak-*
deploy_epi_fixes.py
patch_streak_bonus.py
